{"id":"n15715-1-9","stage":3,"title":"문자 · 文字","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15715-1-9-1","ko":"한글을 쓰기 전에는 조상들이 어떤 문자로 글을 적었나요?","zh":"在开始使用韩文之前，我们的祖先是用什么文字来书写的呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"한글을","meaning":"韩文","explanation":"한글：韩文；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"한글","audio":"/audio/bd87f9bb68b67d2fa1cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91525","senseId":"1","lemma":"한글","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한글을","audio":"/audio/bec97fdcc7468ac9ec29.mp3"}},{"text":"쓰기","meaning":"写，创作","explanation":"쓰다：写，创作；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65172","senseId":"2","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쓰기","audio":"/audio/4c2306809937812ded49.mp3"}},{"text":"전에는","meaning":"以前","explanation":"전：以前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17301","senseId":"1","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전에는","audio":"/audio/647d1c9da315a2e560af.mp3"}},{"text":"조상들이","meaning":"先祖","explanation":"조상：先祖；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"조상","audio":"/audio/c683c7cebed01a94786b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75792","senseId":"1","lemma":"조상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조상들이","audio":"/audio/bb4559318888577f52e1.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어떤：哪一个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"2","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"문자로","meaning":"文字","explanation":"문자：文字；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"문자","audio":"/audio/4ea374f4ded3131b7083.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15715","senseId":"1","lemma":"문자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문자로","audio":"/audio/85ae3c4293aacf545b32.mp3"}},{"text":"글을","meaning":"文章","explanation":"글：文章；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"글","audio":"/audio/f77a9ef73a92993883d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59226","senseId":"1","lemma":"글","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"글을","audio":"/audio/998a3a85cc413d979eb5.mp3"}},{"text":"적었나요?","meaning":"写","explanation":"적다：写；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"적다","audio":"/audio/5f930febe6cd0f79ee06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71234","senseId":"1","lemma":"적다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"적었나요","audio":"/audio/1442ca1635483006540f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"bd87f9bb68b67d2f","term":"한글","zh":"韩文","audio":"/audio/bd87f9bb68b67d2fa1cb.mp3","entryId":"91525","definition":"韩国文字的名称。","pronunciation":["한ː글"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"写，创作","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65172","definition":"将头脑中的想法或感觉等用文字记在纸上而使其现出来。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"d9f427c3257e81e0","term":"전","zh":"以前","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3","entryId":"17301","definition":"过去的某时。","pronunciation":["전"]},{"id":"c683c7cebed01a94","term":"조상","zh":"先祖","audio":"/audio/c683c7cebed01a94786b.mp3","entryId":"75792","definition":"指在一个家庭中先诞生、生活而现已去世的长辈。","pronunciation":["조상"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"哪一个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问在现有的多个人或事物中，作为对象的是什么。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"4ea374f4ded3131b","term":"문자","zh":"文字","audio":"/audio/4ea374f4ded3131b7083.mp3","entryId":"15715","definition":"为使肉眼能够看到语音或语意而记录的符号体系。","pronunciation":["문짜"]},{"id":"f77a9ef73a929938","term":"글","zh":"文章","audio":"/audio/f77a9ef73a92993883d4.mp3","entryId":"59226","definition":"将想法或事情等用文字表达出来。","pronunciation":["글"]},{"id":"5f930febe6cd0f79","term":"적다","zh":"写","audio":"/audio/5f930febe6cd0f79ee06.mp3","entryId":"71234","definition":"把内容用文字书写处理。","pronunciation":["적따"]}],"audio":"/audio/45b382358f64833eada6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15715-1-9-2","ko":"그 전에는 중국의 한자를 빌려서 썼지.","zh":"在那之前，他们是借用中国的汉字来书写的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}},{"text":"전에는","meaning":"以前","explanation":"전：以前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"전","audio":"/audio/d9f427c3257e81e05a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17301","senseId":"1","lemma":"전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전에는","audio":"/audio/647d1c9da315a2e560af.mp3"}},{"text":"중국의","meaning":"中国","explanation":"중국：中国；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"중국의","audio":"/audio/e01430bb0dcbf583cb94.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중국의","audio":"/audio/e01430bb0dcbf583cb94.mp3"}},{"text":"한자를","meaning":"汉字","explanation":"한자：汉字；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"한자","audio":"/audio/2ec27660c6fa3c0acc73.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72461","senseId":"1","lemma":"한자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한자를","audio":"/audio/b3a3f8243d4a49f7669e.mp3"}},{"text":"빌려서","meaning":"借用","explanation":"빌리다：借用；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"빌리다","audio":"/audio/7cc8358d972a7f6932ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17824","senseId":"3","lemma":"빌리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빌려서","audio":"/audio/6c673c33a76b1d7d6dbe.mp3"}},{"text":"썼지.","meaning":"写，创作","explanation":"쓰다：写，创作；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65172","senseId":"2","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL